## 6.2 Multi-Connection Downloading

Implement parallel segmented downloading using HTTP Range requests when supported.

Include:

- Configurable connection counts.
- Parallel segments.
- Segment progress.
- Segment recovery.
- Safe file merging.
- Server capability detection.
- Single-connection fallback.
